{{#> layout
  title='The fastest way to learn a language'
  metaDescription=''
  url='/ai.html'
  ogDescription=''
  navbarAlwaysMurky=true
  navbarSpacing="mb-0"
  navbarContainerClass="container-md"
  noCta=true
  nonStickyNavbar=true
  disabledAutoTrack=true
}}
  <style>
    :root {
      --info-radius: 0.75rem;
      --info-padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .select-language {
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background-position: right var(--info-padding) center;
    }

    .info-panel {
      padding: var(--info-padding);
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--info-radius);
    }

    .info-panel[hidden] {
      display: none;
    }

    #ai-tabs {
      .ai-tabs-nav {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        background: #ececec;
        border-radius: var(--info-radius);
      }

      .ai-tab {
        flex: 1 1 0;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
        border: 0;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--bs-secondary-color);
        border-radius: calc(var(--info-radius) - 0.25rem);
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      }

      .ai-tab:hover {
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
      }

      .ai-tab[aria-selected='true'] {
        background: #fff;
        color: var(--bs-body-color);
        box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      }

      .ai-tab .bi {
        font-size: 1.15em;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .ai-instruction {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .bi-box-arrow-up-right {
        font-size: 0.85em;
        margin-left: 0.35em;
      }
    }
  </style>
  <div class="container-md">
    <div class="pt-3 pb-5">
      <h1 class="h3">The fasted way to language mastery.</h1>

      <p style="font-size: 80%;">This page was created based on a discovery I made and shared at <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/learndutch/s/vlO10JmnUl" target="_blank">r/learndutch community of Reddit<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right ms-2"></i></a>.</p>

      <p>Do you know why children pick up their first language almost effortlessly, while adults struggle with their second language?</p>

      <p>The difference is in the language application:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Children use their first language to ask questions and complain about problems</li>
        <li>Adults use their second language to answer someone's questions and solve someone else's problems</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Children are way more motivated to use their first language because they receive immediate value out of it: their questions get answered and their daily problems get resolve.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9f9f9;">
    <div class="container-md py-5" style="font-size: 80%">
      <h2 class="h5" style="color: var(--bs-body-color); font-size: 140%">How to use AI to advance in your language-learning</h2>

      <p>This section provides necessary steps on how to set up your AI provider (ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude) to not only respond to you in your Target Language, but also evaluate and correct your grammar.</p>

      <div class="mb-5">
        <p>What language are you learning?</p>

        <select id="language" name='language' aria-label='Language' class="select-language form-select form-select-sm mb-4">
          {{#each htmlWebpackPlugin.options.environment.languages}}
            <option value='{{this.code}}'>{{this.label}}</option>
          {{/each}}
        </select>

        <p>Copy the following prompt:</p>

        <style>
          #prompt-wrapper {
            font-size: 90%;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;

            #prompt {
              display: block;
            }

            #copy-button {
              position: absolute;
              bottom: var(--info-padding);
              right: var(--info-padding);
              display: flex;
              align-items: center;
              gap: 0.5rem;
              border-radius: 0.5rem;
              letter-spacing: -0.02em;
              font-size: 90%;
            }
          }
        </style>

        <pre class="info-panel" id="prompt-wrapper"><code id="prompt"></code><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="copy-button"><i class="bi bi-copy"></i><span>Copy</span></button></pre>

        <p>Add the above prompt to the context of AI you are using:</p>

        <div id="ai-tabs" class="mb-4">
          <div class="ai-tabs-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="AI assistant">
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-chatgpt"
              data-ai-tab="chatgpt"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-chatgpt"
              aria-selected="true"
            ><i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i>ChatGPT</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-gemini"
              data-ai-tab="gemini"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-gemini"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-stars"></i>Gemini</button>
            <button
              type="button"
              role="tab"
              class="ai-tab"
              id="ai-tab-claude"
              data-ai-tab="claude"
              aria-controls="ai-panel-claude"
              aria-selected="false"
              tabindex="-1"
            ><i class="bi bi-asterisk"></i>Claude</button>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-chatgpt"
            data-ai-panel="chatgpt"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-chatgpt"
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong>Custom instructions</strong> section of <a
                href="https://chatgpt.com/#settings/Personalization"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Personalization<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-gemini"
            data-ai-panel="gemini"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-gemini"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Open <a
                href="https://gemini.google.com/saved-info"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Personal context<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>, tick the <strong>Your instructions for
                Gemini</strong> checkbox, then click <strong>+ Add</strong> and paste the prompt.</p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="info-panel"
            role="tabpanel"
            id="ai-panel-claude"
            data-ai-panel="claude"
            aria-labelledby="ai-tab-claude"
            hidden
          >
            <p class="ai-instruction">Paste the prompt into the <strong>Instructions for Claude</strong> section of your <a
                href="https://claude.ai/settings/profile"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener"
                class="link-secondary"
              >Claude Profile<i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p>Now, the most difficult part: start solving your daily problems in <span data-language-string>your Target Language</span>. This won't be easy at the beginning and you will have to look up many new words while formulating the question and understanding the response. But this hardness is exactly how the fluency in a foreign language is created. You can do it.</p>
      </div>
      {{> social-share
        page="ai.html"
      }}
    </div>
  </div>
{{/layout}}

